    old "Each market they hit would deliver them a big haul, but so big that the customers and merchants would soon be in an uproar."
    new "그들이 들르는 시장마다 큰 수익을 안겨주었지만, 그 수익이 너무 커서 고객과 상인들은 곧 분노에 차게 될 것이었다."

    old "With multiple victims complaining, the otherwise lethargic city guard felt compelled to step up their efforts."
