    old "Yeah. Live is pretty cheap livin out here."
    new "응. 여기서는 살아남는 게 꽤 싸거든."

    old "Sarah eyed Alaric."
    new "사라는 알라리크를 쳐다보았다."

    old "I was thinking we could use the money to maybe move up a bit."
    new "우리가 그 돈으로 상황을 좀 나아지게 할 수 있을지도 모른다고 생각했어."

    old "Ooh, too good to be fucked in an alley are we?"
