    old "A hard life had given him a hard body. The many scars bore testament to this unspoken and yet obvious truth."
    new "고된 삶은 그에게 단단한 몸을 만들어 주었다. 수많은 흉터는 이 말하지 않았지만 명백한 사실을 증명하고 있었다."

    old "Sarah reached out and slid her hand across his stomach and chest, pausing near every blemish and imperfection."
