    old "Honestly, I've been out here so long, it hardly make a difference anymore. But I guess it could be nice for a change."
    new "솔직히 말해서, 내가 여기서 너무 오래 있었더니 이제는 별 차이가 없어. 하지만 변화가 있다면 좋을지도 모르겠지."

    old "Sarah pushed herself up, laying herself on top of him. She felt her breasts press into his stone skin. She looked up at him."
