    old "Don't be disgusting.."
    new "역겨워하지 마..."

    old "I meant for everything since we met. Helping me learn about the streets, saving my life, just..."
    new "우리가 처음 만났을 때부터 모든 걸 의미했던 거야. 거리 생활에 대해 알려주고, 내 목숨을 구해준 것까지... 그냥..."

    old "I was alone when we met, and I don't feel so alone anymore."
    new "우리가 처음 만났을 때 난 혼자였는데, 이제는 그렇게 외롭지 않다는 생각이 들어."

    old "Alaric wrapped his arm around her waist and pulled her up to him."
